• 3-6 years of work experience in operations (transportation) in Portugal and/or Spain or a dynamic daily environment (handling daily incoming requests) ability to adequately deal with different stakeholders (bus terminal managers, bus drivers, operations supervisors or regional authorities) with high social and negotiation skills;

• Trustworthiness, engagement, resourcefulness and flexibility, as well as a hands-on mentality. Independent, reliable and responsible working style;

• Organized and full respectful of the Flixbus processes and protocols;

• You are willing to travel at least monthly. most of the times with one overnight. Occasional international travelling (max. twice a year);

• Portuguese (native/proficient speaker level), highly fluent in English. Language skills&nbsp;will be tested. Spanish is a plus.

• Know how to motivate internal and external stakeholders, and how to prioritize and organize yourself between incoming daily requests and longer-term tasks.

